es-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"tXhxuMj05o8","position":25,"timestamp":"00:54:21","rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - Head High","track":{"id":"R2ph8WuIJCM","path":"/artists/joey-bada/tracks/head-high/","slug":"head-high","title":"Head High","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":"images/artists/joey-bada/tracks/head-high.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ddAGagrCyGY","slug":"556","tags":[6,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-556/ra.1628917589","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-556"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #556","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-556.jpg","content":"Joe goes all over the map with jungle, beats, and house music.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-07-09T08:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"EfNfBL-D7Vg","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - Funky Ho'S","track":{"id":"TvSyZr-NC0s","path":"/artists/joey-bada/tracks/funky-ho-s/","slug":"funky-hos","title":"Funky Ho'S","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":"images/artists/joey-bada/tracks/funky-ho-s.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andres' Set","position":2}},{"id":"H-SEnaD2wEI","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - Hillary $wank","track":{"id":"kLiWWFcde-k","path":"/artists/joey-badass/tracks/hillary-wank/","slug":"hillary-wank","title":"Hillary $wank","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"kT5Wn7avOKc","slug":"155","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-155"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #155","artwork":"/images/episodes/155.jpg","content":"Joe Kay brings you 60 minute mix of his favorite selects for this past week just for you. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3656,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-07T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"VvL5DvlrQO8","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - DSL (Da Special List)","track":{"id":"q12yMq-Fwl0","path":"/artists/joey-bada/tracks/dsl-da-special-list/","slug":"dsl-da-special-list","title":"DSL (Da Special List)","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":"images/artists/joey-bada/tracks/dsl-da-special-list.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"72tsP5bkPCY","slug":"157","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-157"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #157","artwork":"/images/episodes/157.jpg","content":"Joe Kay drops a 60 minute set of some stand out selects that he either just discovered, was holding onto, and rediscovered. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe played back a few cuts from last week such as the intro track by Yung Gud! God this track is a bad one even Sango is opening up with it at his recent shows.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3723,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"dXfxlVPCTsk","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - Christ Conscious","track":{"id":"bLWe7jQbWTM","path":"/artists/joey-bada/tracks/christ-conscious/","slug":"christ-conscious","title":"Christ Conscious","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":"images/artists/joey-bada/tracks/christ-conscious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays's Session","position":1}},{"id":"j1EfFxIVMzQ","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - Funky Ho'$ [Prod. By Lord Finesse]","track":{"id":"34lKEmKsdvk","path":"/artists/joey-badass/tracks/funky-ho-prod-by-lord-finesse/","slug":"funky-ho-prod-by-lord-finesse","title":"Funky Ho'$ [Prod. By Lord Finesse]","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-uURW8Z5N2A","slug":"206","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-206-w-chris-mcclenney-da-p"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #206 w/ Chris McClenney & Da-P","artwork":"/images/episodes/206.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11010,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"knQaoWK8U_k","position":16,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Joey Bada$$ - Hillary $wank [Prod. By Lee Bannon]","track":{"id":"RwIJFxtdi9I","path":"/artists/joey-badass/tracks/hillary-wank-prod-by-lee-bannon/","slug":"hillary-wank-prod-by-lee-bannon","title":"Hillary $wank [Prod. By Lee Bannon]","artist":{"slug":"joey-bada","title":"Joey Bada$$"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"GjAftU6qHdI","slug":"239","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-239-w-anderson-paak"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #239 w/ A